WEBVTT

00:00:00.434 --> 00:00:01.090
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.101 --> 00:00:03.613
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> What’s she famous <b>for</b>?

00:00:05.532 --> 00:00:06.151
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:07.211 --> 00:00:08.649
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Why are you angry <b>with</b> him?

00:00:10.638 --> 00:00:11.358
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:12.391 --> 00:00:13.903
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> There’s nothing to be afraid <b>of</b>.

00:00:15.885 --> 00:00:16.522
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:17.495 --> 00:00:19.446
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I’m quite good <b>at</b> tennis.

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:22.164
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:23.141 --> 00:00:25.185
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Sugar is bad <b>for</b> your teeth.

00:00:27.116 --> 00:00:27.908
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:28.947 --> 00:00:31.213
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> You’re always full <b>of</b> great ideas.

00:00:33.181 --> 00:00:33.903
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:34.855 --> 00:00:36.099
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> What are you interested <b>in</b>?

00:00:38.117 --> 00:00:38.657
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:00:39.714 --> 00:00:41.242
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> They weren’t very nice <b>to</b> me.